@startuml
title Staff Member State Machine Diagram


[*] --> Unassigned

state Unassigned
Unassigned : entry / New staff member added
Unassigned : do / No assignment yet
Unassigned : exit / Ready for assignment


Unassigned --> AssignedToClientOrCampaign : [Assignment to client or campaign]


state "Assigned to Client or Campaign" as AssignedToClientOrCampaign
AssignedToClientOrCampaign : entry / Staff member assigned to client or campaign
AssignedToClientOrCampaign : do / Working on assignment
AssignedToClientOrCampaign : exit / Ready for reassignment


AssignedToClientOrCampaign --> Unassigned : [Removal from assignment]
AssignedToClientOrCampaign --> AssignedToClientOrCampaign : [Switching between assignments during work period]


AssignedToClientOrCampaign --> Unemployed : [Staff member leaving job]


state "Unemployed" as Unemployed
Unemployed : entry / Staff member marked as unemployed
Unemployed : do / No longer working
Unemployed : exit / Ready for archiving


Unemployed --> Archived : [Time passing]


state "Archived" as Archived
Archived : entry / Staff member record archived
Archived : do / Record no longer active
Archived : exit / End of state machine


Archived --> [*] : [End]

@enduml
